<div data-cgap-sector="Chemical Plants &amp; Handling" data-cgap-term="chemical"></div><p class="lead">Chemical hazards are specific. A sign that just says &quot;Chemicals&quot; does not tell anyone that a regulated area needs an entry log, that a reactor cannot be restarted with the agitator off, or that a tank car has to be chocked and grounded before the hose goes on.</p><p>These signs are written for each chemical and each step: acids and corrosives, toxic gases like chlorine and ammonia, OSHA regulated areas such as methylene chloride and benzene, flammable solvent storage, reactors and process vessels, tank car and tank truck unloading, line breaking, and hazardous waste and spill response. They are 8x12 rust-resistant aluminum.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area il-best"><h3>Most ordered</h3><p>The signs customers in this industry order most.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-hazardous-waste-storage-area-sign-keep-out-8x12-aluminum">Hazardous Waste Storage Area</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/methylene-chloride-regulated-area-sign-osha-1910-1052-8x12-aluminum">Methylene Chloride Regulated Area</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/cgap-safety-danger-hydrofluoric-acid-handling-sign-8x12-aluminum-extreme-burn-toxicity-warning-for-labs-industrial-sites">Hydrofluoric Acid Handling</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/chemical-danger-sign-corrosive-burn-hazard-for-operations-and-maintenance-hubs-8x12-uv-resistant-rust-resistant-aluminum-professional-facility-grade-by-cgap-safety">Chemical</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Acids and corrosives</h3><p>Acid and caustic storage, transfer and splash zones. 84 signs. Typical spot: Mount on the drum transfer station beside the hose connection.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/cgap-safety-danger-hydrofluoric-acid-handling-sign-8x12-aluminum-extreme-burn-toxicity-warning-for-labs-industrial-sites">Hydrofluoric Acid Handling</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-acid-drum-transfer-hose-sign-cgap-w01903-812">Acid Drum Transfer Hose</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-caustic-pump-cart-sign-cgap-c16554-812">Caustic Pump Cart</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-acid-metering-pump-sign-cgap-n10382-812">Acid Metering Pump</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Toxic gases</h3><p>Chlorine, ammonia and other toxic gas areas. 23 signs. Typical spot: Drum storage and opening area.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-aqua-ammonia-drums-sign-8x12-aluminum">Aqua Ammonia Drums</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-ammonia-truck-unloading-hose-sign-cgap-w15050-812">Ammonia Truck Unloading Hose</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-hydrogen-sulfide-area-sign-cgap-i22597-812">Hydrogen Sulfide Area</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-chlorine-evaporator-sign-8x12-aluminum">Chlorine Evaporator</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>OSHA regulated areas</h3><p>Regulated areas, entry logs and exposure limits. 86 signs. Typical spot: Mount at the benzene area floor, on the wall inside the benzene area.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/methylene-chloride-regulated-area-sign-osha-1910-1052-8x12-aluminum">Methylene Chloride Regulated Area</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-benzene-area-floor-sign-cgap-c19625-812">Benzene Area Floor</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-butadiene-sample-station-sign-cgap-n25495-812">Butadiene Sample Station</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-benzene-area-exit-sign-cgap-i20108-812">Benzene Area Exit</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Flammable solvents and storage</h3><p>Solvent rooms, flammable storage and blending. 139 signs. Typical spot: Tank rim or manway.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-solvent-mix-tank-sign-8x12-aluminum">Solvent Mix Tank</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-solvent-mixer-shaft-sign-cgap-w00301-812">Solvent Mixer Shaft</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-solvent-tote-staging-sign-cgap-c06478-812">Solvent Tote Staging</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-solvent-drum-pump-sign-cgap-n03718-812">Solvent Drum Pump</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Reactors and process vessels</h3><p>Reactors, kettles, agitators and columns. 321 signs. Typical spot: Column manways and hot work permit board.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-packed-column-sign-8x12-aluminum">Packed Column</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-reactor-jacket-sign-cgap-w00297-812">Reactor Jacket</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-column-tray-edges-sign-cgap-c19623-812">Column Tray Edges</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-column-manway-sign-cgap-n18057-812">Column Manway</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Tank car and tank truck unloading</h3><p>Rail and truck unloading spots. 183 signs. Typical spot: At styrene railcar unloading spots.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-styrene-railcar-sign-8x12-aluminum">Styrene Railcar</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-ibc-tote-mixer-mount-sign-cgap-w02700-812">IBC Tote Mixer Mount</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-tote-rack-edge-sign-cgap-c06477-812">Tote Rack Edge</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-tote-storage-row-sign-cgap-n20752-812">Tote Storage Row</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Line breaking and piping</h3><p>Opening lines, process piping and hoses. 146 signs. Typical spot: Valves, flanges and pump connections on oleum lines.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-oleum-line-break-sign-8x12-aluminum">Oleum Line Break</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-column-reboiler-flange-sign-cgap-w00298-812">Column Reboiler Flange</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-transfer-hose-rack-sign-cgap-c01697-812">Transfer Hose Rack</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-tank-farm-hose-rack-sign-cgap-n18194-812">Tank Farm Hose Rack</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Hazardous waste and spills</h3><p>Waste storage, drums and spill response. 45 signs. Typical spot: Mount at the lead area waste bin, on the bin.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-hazardous-waste-storage-area-sign-keep-out-8x12-aluminum">Hazardous Waste Storage Area</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-lead-area-waste-bin-sign-cgap-c20305-812">Lead Area Waste Bin</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-reactor-area-spill-kit-sign-cgap-n09509-812">Reactor Area Spill Kit</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-mercury-spill-kit-sign-cgap-i22251-812">Mercury Spill Kit</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>Do you have signs for OSHA regulated areas?</summary><p>Yes, including methylene chloride, benzene, cadmium and other regulated area signs, plus entry log signs. Search the chemical name to see them.</p></details><details><summary>Which signs go in a chemical storage room?</summary><p>Typical postings name the hazard stored there, separate incompatible chemicals, list the PPE required and show where the eyewash and spill kit are. Search &quot;chemical storage&quot; to see the options.</p></details><details><summary>Do you sell signs for individual chemicals?</summary><p>Yes. Many signs are written for one chemical, such as hydrofluoric acid, chlorine, caustic soda or methylene chloride. Search the chemical name to find them.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have signs for OSHA regulated areas?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including methylene chloride, benzene, cadmium and other regulated area signs, plus entry log signs. Search the chemical name to see them."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Which signs go in a chemical storage room?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Typical postings name the hazard stored there, separate incompatible chemicals, list the PPE required and show where the eyewash and spill kit are. Search \"chemical storage\" to see the options."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you sell signs for individual chemicals?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Many signs are written for one chemical, such as hydrofluoric acid, chlorine, caustic soda or methylene chloride. Search the chemical name to find them."}}]}</script>